  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring of the sea turtles nesting beaches by the creation of the Marine National Park of Manyange na Elombo Campo (Cameroon, South zone) and improvement of the knowledge of the teachers of The EFG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will: 1)organize community based survey teams to survey and protect nests and turtles on 8 turtle nesting beaches within the proposed Elombo Campo MPA October through May; 2) provide technical support to the Ministry of Forests and Wildlife to support creation of the Manyange Na Elombo Campo MPA; and 3) conduct a one week training seminar on sea turtles and conservation techniques for the Garoua Wildlife Management School.</narrative>
  </description>
